{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/9866d468f4b3186e8b2f04853e37bd81.webp?t=1776399816\" width=372 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ten Thousand Coins: The Golden Merchant</i></strong> is a story-rich strategy trading game. Guide the fox merchant Viia on her journey of trades, profits, and survival through the danger-ridden land of Grand Emperium as she battles fate and fortune against the mighty Basilisk Company. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/95b5dfe506344ac354d094ef2fe0a5ce.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/95b5dfe506344ac354d094ef2fe0a5ce.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/95b5dfe506344ac354d094ef2fe0a5ce.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years prior, while a Ravenn merchant trades in this war-ravaged land, he makes a shocking discovery and finds a mysterious little companion. His actions and tribulations   will determine the fate of those who journey after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/8e6ff82ba797850bccb2789a042c1977.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover non-linear character-driven stories set in a fantasy world filled with trade and opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d866da26d2be9e9cbdf73c595cf0e0bd.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d866da26d2be9e9cbdf73c595cf0e0bd.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d866da26d2be9e9cbdf73c595cf0e0bd.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/57fefad9a2a037693854286c026b9a8e.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of trading between settlements with resource and inventory management. Barter goods directly with traders while balancing their moods and needs. Knowing what goods and when to offer them is the key to a successful trade. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/a33bc28102a85d4c7feba56d62f6c50b.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/a33bc28102a85d4c7feba56d62f6c50b.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/a33bc28102a85d4c7feba56d62f6c50b.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/2915ab20c748928b2fc3173e608252ba.webp?t=1776399816\" width=372 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild a merchant company in our Company Mode. Play as a masked merchant, earn coins on various jobs and rebuild a merchant company back to its former glory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/507af793271e9b2eb96d608eb8e17156.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/507af793271e9b2eb96d608eb8e17156.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/507af793271e9b2eb96d608eb8e17156.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d421c56b329789db682c3fc4f7d93b6e.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bandits and wild beasts are constantly eyeing your wagons. Experience turn-based combat with a merchant twist: each of your trading goods can be used for attacking or defending with its own unique effects.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/c367caad78aee206340ceb067a4fcc47.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/c367caad78aee206340ceb067a4fcc47.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/c367caad78aee206340ceb067a4fcc47.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, negotiate or intimidate your way out for a peaceful resolution! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/f3ccfab92cf0012260631681f6186f1a.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode - An immersive and character-focused storyline spanning two timelines. Make impactful choices to craft your journey to the end. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Company Mode - Play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company and rebuild a rundown company building back to its former glory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crisp, fully hand-drawn anime-inspired art style.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colourful characters, cities and settlements to explore, trade, and build a reputation with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique goods to discover, use, and trade with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and assemble various guards &amp; travellers and build your merchant convoy to aid you on your travels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random wilderness encounters to navigate through and challenging enemies to battle against. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/ae3ecd7432c8ef4c07e3848ba74b2c60.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1157900?t=1776399816","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1157900?t=1776399816","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/d9b7b7b4a34e57acb9a06af55c03a59eeee838d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1776399816","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/d9b7b7b4a34e57acb9a06af55c03a59eeee838d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1776399816","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":1322400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Follow Us!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d97652af01bdb8703d5909976a18629b.avif?t=1776399816\" width=295 height=131 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/ad8ba8a57c16f2dc0e648c265d114b80.avif?t=1776399816\" width=295 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist &amp; Follow</strong> us here on Steam for the latest development updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit our <strong>Website\u00a0</strong>to join our Discord server and our <strong>Mailing List</strong> for a chance to become an Alpha &amp; Beta tester! </p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/9866d468f4b3186e8b2f04853e37bd81.webp?t=1776399816\" width=372 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ten Thousand Coins: The Golden Merchant</i></strong> is a story-rich strategy trading game. Guide the fox merchant Viia on her journey of trades, profits, and survival through the danger-ridden land of Grand Emperium as she battles fate and fortune against the mighty Basilisk Company. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/95b5dfe506344ac354d094ef2fe0a5ce.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/95b5dfe506344ac354d094ef2fe0a5ce.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/95b5dfe506344ac354d094ef2fe0a5ce.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years prior, while a Ravenn merchant trades in this war-ravaged land, he makes a shocking discovery and finds a mysterious little companion. His actions and tribulations   will determine the fate of those who journey after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/8e6ff82ba797850bccb2789a042c1977.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover non-linear character-driven stories set in a fantasy world filled with trade and opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d866da26d2be9e9cbdf73c595cf0e0bd.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d866da26d2be9e9cbdf73c595cf0e0bd.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d866da26d2be9e9cbdf73c595cf0e0bd.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/57fefad9a2a037693854286c026b9a8e.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of trading between settlements with resource and inventory management. Barter goods directly with traders while balancing their moods and needs. Knowing what goods and when to offer them is the key to a successful trade. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/a33bc28102a85d4c7feba56d62f6c50b.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/a33bc28102a85d4c7feba56d62f6c50b.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/a33bc28102a85d4c7feba56d62f6c50b.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/2915ab20c748928b2fc3173e608252ba.webp?t=1776399816\" width=372 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebuild a merchant company in our Company Mode. Play as a masked merchant, earn coins on various jobs and rebuild a merchant company back to its former glory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/507af793271e9b2eb96d608eb8e17156.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/507af793271e9b2eb96d608eb8e17156.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/507af793271e9b2eb96d608eb8e17156.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/d421c56b329789db682c3fc4f7d93b6e.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bandits and wild beasts are constantly eyeing your wagons. Experience turn-based combat with a merchant twist: each of your trading goods can be used for attacking or defending with its own unique effects.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/c367caad78aee206340ceb067a4fcc47.poster.avif?t=1776399816\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/c367caad78aee206340ceb067a4fcc47.webm?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/c367caad78aee206340ceb067a4fcc47.mp4?t=1776399816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, negotiate or intimidate your way out for a peaceful resolution! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/f3ccfab92cf0012260631681f6186f1a.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode - An immersive and character-focused storyline spanning two timelines. Make impactful choices to craft your journey to the end. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Company Mode - Play as a masked merchant of the Ravenn Company and rebuild a rundown company building back to its former glory. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crisp, fully hand-drawn anime-inspired art style.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colourful characters, cities and settlements to explore, trade, and build a reputation with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique goods to discover, use, and trade with. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and assemble various guards &amp; travellers and build your merchant convoy to aid you on your travels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random wilderness encounters to navigate through and challenging enemies to battle against. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/extras/ae3ecd7432c8ef4c07e3848ba74b2c60.webp?t=1776399816\" width=600 height=36 /></span></p>","developers":["Thousand Tonic"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1157900/19ee58ec737a759b969c36c5fb6c10f1a3bd7a79/header.jpg?t=1776399816","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1157900/1377158796/5537cf48a387